{"availability":"available","full":"OluwamuyiwaJaiyeola/rul-predictive-maintenance","name":"rul-predictive-maintenance","description":"ML-powered RUL prediction for a 50-robot fleet using 18 months of sensor data. On four held-out failure robots, the final Random Forest model achieved R² 0.862, flagged all four, and provided a minimum 9.8-day warning. Deployed as an interactive Gradio app to Hugging Face Spaces through GitHub Actions.","category":"Education","language":"Jupyter Notebook","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-04-26T04:03:20Z","updated":"2026-08-30T01:23:56Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/ThatBlvck/kataoka-rul-predictive-maintenance","topics":["ci-cd","gradio","machine-learning","mlops","predictive-maintenance","regression","remaining-useful-life-prediction","sensor-data","time-series"],"demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/ThatBlvck/kataoka-rul-predictive-maintenance","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:49:07.792Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T19:49:07.792Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T19:49:07.792Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T22:34:55.084Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T19:49:07.792Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An end-to-end machine learning system that estimates the Remaining Useful Life (RUL) of industrial robots and converts predictions into maintenance risk alerts."],"features":["Fifteen time-series and compound features were created to capture degradation patterns that raw sensor values missed.","After the seven-day rolling window was applied, 459 warm-up rows were removed. The resulting engineered dataset contained 14,786 rows and 40 columns."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/OluwamuyiwaJaiyeola/rul-predictive-maintenance/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"742cba8a00f5cc1203778989cdc5f0377fee1d7dd052019655afd5d9740d4229","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:55.214Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:55.214Z","